cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HVRS-7, please cite it as below, together with the DriveAgent dataset."
title: "HVRS-7: Human-Verified Road-Scene Marks for DriveAgent Route R1"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-14
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahsanulhaque1231/HVRS-7"
url: "https://github.com/ahsanulhaque1231/HVRS-7"
abstract: >-
  Human point and bounding-box annotations of seven road-scene classes, including
  pedestrians, for 300 forward-camera frames of Route R1 of the public DriveAgent
  dataset, with frame-level review and unclear flags, a frame index with checksums,
  an offline annotation tool, and scripts.
keywords:
  - autonomous driving
  - road-scene recognition
  - human annotation
  - pedestrian
  - vision-language models
  - DriveAgent
authors:
